          "unstructured": "Kneipp K. et al. abstract 24 presented at the 23rd Annual Conference of the Federation of Analytical Chemistry and Spectroscopy Societies Kansas City MO 29 September to 4 October 1996.",
          "key": "e_1_3_1_17_2",
